[{"type": "subtitle", "time": 3602.63, "timestamp": "01:00:02", "text": "いいえ、インドのユーチューバーを検索すると、"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 3605.19, "timestamp": "01:00:05", "text": "私がインド人を検索しても、誰も検索しないだろう。うん、"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 3608.71, "timestamp": "01:00:08", "text": "範囲と恋人の少年が追加されました"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 3610.39, "timestamp": "01:00:10", "text": "歌。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 3623.51, "timestamp": "01:00:23", "text": "半分インド人で半分アメリカ人のユーチューバー"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 3635.19, "timestamp": "01:00:35", "text": "待って、待って。この人は誰ですか？彼女はインド人ですか？"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 3637.43, "timestamp": "01:00:37", "text": "違いがある。いいえ、インド人です"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 3639.43, "timestamp": "01:00:39", "text": "アメリカ人。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 3643.27, "timestamp": "01:00:43", "text": "あれはアメリカ先住民で、"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 3645.27, "timestamp": "01:00:45", "text": "インドには別の種類の権利がある"}, {"type": "chat", "time": 3648.71, "timestamp": "01:00:48", "author": "@aniketwande4403", "avatar": "https://yt4.ggpht.com/ytc/AIdro_m_Z2M4vVHkWPdw0fzo-i-Dy4Pm4-b-bs22Utnn5zkWBHY=s64-c-k-c0x00ffffff-no-rj", "message": "natives"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 3649.19, "timestamp": "01:00:49", "text": "私たちのインド人よりも、それもあります。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 3652.63, "timestamp": "01:00:52", "text": "だから、ほとんどの場合、私は"}, {"type": "chat", "time": 3655.519, "timestamp": "01:00:55", "author": "@aniketwande4403", "avatar": "https://yt4.ggpht.com/ytc/AIdro_m_Z2M4vVHkWPdw0fzo-i-Dy4Pm4-b-bs22Utnn5zkWBHY=s64-c-k-c0x00ffffff-no-rj", "message": "native indians"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 3657.349, "timestamp": "01:00:57", "text": "時々混乱する。"}]